						<td class="headline" align="left"><a name="#734">WELCOME, FRIEND!</a></td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							FOLLOW TUNARES WAY.FOLLOW THE PATH OF GLORY AND PRIDE.FIND FRIENDSHIP LOVE AND YOUR FATE INTO A NEW ROLEPLAY GUILD.MAKE HISTORY AND HELP TO CREATE A NEW FUTURE.JOIN THE GUARDIAN ANGELS OF TUNARE.<br />
<br />
This guild is under construction. If you have any questions then feel free to ask Manuvian or Temra into the everquest game, on Firiona Vie, or send a E-mail to ManuvianTriolith@Hotmail.com or to TemraTriolith@Hotmail.com. We have also a page on Guildmagic.com<br />
<br />
Yipppiiee,Hurraaayy! The final Guild set up is done now.Thanks to the 10 of our 24 members they helped us to make the dream comes true.We have to wait now 1 or 2 weeks long then we should get our name tag.<br />
<br />
What will come true in time into our guild?<br />
<br />
The plan is to create a special command structure over time that make sure to have more titles in the guild other than just officers and leaders based on how the guild grows in population and it's needs, create our own quests, create new events like duel contests, some with special rules as example duel into the air, or a race with new rules like horse race and other things like that, different kinds of alliances with other good guilds of Faydwer, our own guild bank, the makeup determined by those that would participate, trades to and with other guilds. And many more............<br />
<br />
<br />
At last a example how our guild would never be.look at this website and be happy to have a family like ours http://www.fohguild.org/html/recruit.php
