				<td width="100%">
					<table width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="2" border="0">
					<tr>
						<td class="headline" align="left"><a name="#733">What we think should be the perfect guild?</a></td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							We know many guilds call themselves &quot;family&quot; or &quot;elite&quot; guild. But at last, they all wanna be big guilds and invite as many people as they can. But if a guild has too many members then it can destroy all because the people dont know each other good enough. They are not close enough together and no one care about the other anymore. That's a lot usually the main problem with a big guild. So I think our guild should be a smaller guild. We dont need to have the most members of all other guilds. What we need is a guild with the best members. With friends. For all persons in guild it will be not easy because no one can to forget to follow our guild rules. Some basically are: Don't be greedy, don't be selfish, try to help whenever you can, be loyal, be friendly, dont steal camps, try to to roleplay whenever possible, be ready to defend your home and family not only important what may happen with you, but always what is the best for the family. That was only some examples a more complete list of rules and goals is in the works now and will be soon to follow...<br />
<br />
<br />
This would be our Guild and when we say our then we mean the guild frome all members because we think a leader is also a member like all others into the guild. We are nothing without friends and family and the guild members are a family so they are also nothing without me and Manuvian we all are a piece of this guild and we all have to work on the guild. So we hope that many friends into this guild have new and own ideas and thoughts about us or what we can make new and better. And we hope they talk with us and all other friends about it so we can realize these thoughts. Thats the right way how we can make the guild so special and strong for us all. The only way to make anything better...
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							<br>
														<strong>By:</strong>
							<span class="name"> <a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=5168">Temra Triolith</a> at 2:10 AM PST - January 18th, 2003</span>
						</td>
					</tr>
