						<td class="body">
							<br>
														<strong>By:</strong>
							<span class="name"> <a href="http://www.guildsay.com/guilds/view_character.php?id=5173">Manuvian Aspenleaf</a> at 2:09 AM PST - January 18th, 2003</span>
